Error [E0108]: Field `a` of `Pair.Ints` holds Int (a whole number), but this value is String (text)
  --> enum_variant_payload_field_type.jet:7:23
    |
  7 |     p :: Pair.Ints{a: "not an int", b: true}
    |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A variant payload keeps the type its enum declaration gives it
 Fix: Use Int (a whole number) here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108

Error [E0108]: Field `b` of `Pair.Ints` holds Int (a whole number), but this value is Bool (true or false)
  --> enum_variant_payload_field_type.jet:7:40
    |
  7 |     p :: Pair.Ints{a: "not an int", b: true}
    |                                        ^^^^
 Why: A variant payload keeps the type its enum declaration gives it
 Fix: Use Int (a whole number) here
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0108

Error [E0108]: The payload of `Pair.One` holds Int (a whole number), but this value is String (text)
  --> enum_variant_payload_field_type.jet:8:19
    |
  8 |     q :: Pair.One("text")
    |                   ^^^^^^
 Why: A variant payload keeps the type its enum declaration gives it
